      "updated": 1794800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built by Claude (AI) on 16.–17.11.2026 from Anna (@annaothercrow)'s thesis, sheets and choices. Read left to right: why this board exists, the open cycle, the tools, the thesis in the middle, the research from before, the sub-questions. Dashed teal = AI draft. Blue = question. Lines tagged (Anna) are Anna's words; empty slots are Anna's to fill. Everything you add is yours. The earlier start map (start-here.excalidraw) stays as reference.",
      "originalText": "Built by Claude (AI) on 16.–17.11.2026 from Anna (@annaothercrow)'s thesis, sheets and choices. Read left to right: why this board exists, the open cycle, the tools, the thesis in the middle, the research from before, the sub-questions. Dashed teal = AI draft. Blue = question. Lines tagged (Anna) are Anna's words; empty slots are Anna's to fill. Everything you add is yours. The earlier start map (start-here.excalidraw) stays as reference.",
