      "text": "Phase 1 · Understand · agreed 16.11.2026 · Claude's wording from Anna's words, accepted by Anna · also the overview in one sentence (#19)",
      "originalText": "Phase 1 · Understand · agreed 16.11.2026 · Claude's wording from Anna's words, accepted by Anna · also the overview in one sentence (#19)",
