      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Time: a 1-week test cycle, 17.–23.11.2026, then evaluate; the overall goal is done when it's done. Place: my desk with\nsmall affordable examples, online forums, makerspaces, PC and repo, inside the game, the design board. Type: research\nthrough design + first-person research.",
      "originalText": "Time: a 1-week test cycle, 17.–23.11.2026, then evaluate; the overall goal is done when it's done. Place: my desk with small affordable examples, online forums, makerspaces, PC and repo, inside the game, the design board. Type: research through design + first-person research.",
