      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 14.11.2026: a cycle starts from a research question built on a design thesis. How to word both became item\n#28.",
      "originalText": "• 14.11.2026: a cycle starts from a research question built on a design thesis. How to word both became item #28.",
