      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "No method covers the whole loop; the closest is semantic waves,\nwhose risk is going down and never climbing back up. Build the\nclimb in, check from inside the task, more help at new layers.\nMost sources were seen only as summaries.",
      "originalText": "No method covers the whole loop; the closest is semantic waves, whose risk is going down and never climbing back up. Build the climb in, check from inside the task, more help at new layers. Most sources were seen only as summaries.",
