      "text": "• Problem: I search, collect and sort\nsources, then never look at them again; I go\nvery far to have everything at hand before I\nstart; and get overwhelmed and demotivated,\nphysically and mentally drained.",
      "originalText": "• Problem: I search, collect and sort sources, then never look at them again; I go very far to have everything at hand before I start; and get overwhelmed and demotivated, physically and mentally drained.",
