      "versionNonce": 900810,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• What happened (Anna, her words): I got stuck in a loop of\nsearching and amassing sources, organizing them and then never\nlooking at them again. When I started looking at building\nneurodivergent assistance smart home devices (a speech to\nvisualized context engine, the predecessor of this try), I ended\nup with about 120 bookmarks organized among 8ish categories and\nsub categories. When I was looking to get started on hardware\nhacking, I acquired lists of optimal starting points, optimal\nstarting equipment, etc. and ended up going very very far to have\neverything at hand and would have had to spend between 4-800 euros\nto buy everything at once which I cant. I havent looked at most of\nthe links since.",
      "originalText": "• What happened (Anna, her words): I got stuck in a loop of searching and amassing sources, organizing them and then never looking at them again. When I started looking at building neurodivergent assistance smart home devices (a speech to visualized context engine, the predecessor of this try), I ended up with about 120 bookmarks organized among 8ish categories and sub categories. When I was looking to get started on hardware hacking, I acquired lists of optimal starting points, optimal starting equipment, etc. and ended up going very very far to have everything at hand and would have had to spend between 4-800 euros to buy everything at once which I cant. I havent looked at most of the links since.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
