      "text": "• What I'd like to know: where to really start (Claude); what I\nneed first, not all at once (Claude); how to get where I want to\nend up, what I can do with what I have now, if there is\nworkarounds/alternatives to the required components like diy",
      "originalText": "• What I'd like to know: where to really start (Claude); what I need first, not all at once (Claude); how to get where I want to end up, what I can do with what I have now, if there is workarounds/alternatives to the required components like diy",
