      "text": "• Assumptions to look at: I need everything at hand before I start\n(Claude); the \"optimal\" list fits me (Claude); saving a link means\nI'll come back to it (Claude); i cannot just buy something to\nstart, not knowing everything will hinder me, not having\neverything planned out means I will fail, not understanding\neverything means I will fail",
