      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Why it happens: my fear of missing important facts;\nimpulsiveness, hyperfocus; learning places are top-down; nobody\npicks the first step with me (Claude); collecting feels like\nprogress (Claude); not having everything at hand leaves me stuck\nand interrupts flow so much so that I stop working on things\naltogether",
      "originalText": "• Why it happens: my fear of missing important facts; impulsiveness, hyperfocus; learning places are top-down; nobody picks the first step with me (Claude); collecting feels like progress (Claude); not having everything at hand leaves me stuck and interrupts flow so much so that I stop working on things altogether",
