      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Why it isn't solved yet: solo projects have no one to pick the\nfirst step (Claude); the lists assume a learner who can buy it all\n(Claude); I haven't found a start that fits me (Claude); i havent\nfound an approach that fits me, my energy and motivation\nfluctuates, i dont see progress, motivation comes by imagination\nof what could be and now what is and when reality doesnt match\nsoon enough my head keeps dreaming until I get overwhelmed and\ndemotivated",
      "originalText": "• Why it isn't solved yet: solo projects have no one to pick the first step (Claude); the lists assume a learner who can buy it all (Claude); I haven't found a start that fits me (Claude); i havent found an approach that fits me, my energy and motivation fluctuates, i dont see progress, motivation comes by imagination of what could be and now what is and when reality doesnt match soon enough my head keeps dreaming until I get overwhelmed and demotivated",
