    {
      "id": "a18-card-gw-t7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1432.0,
      "y": 6415.5,
      "width": 744.0,
      "height": 100.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f1ece2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-a18-card-gw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 900887,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 900888,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• The problem, in detail: I search, collect and sort sources, then\nnever look at them again; about 120 bookmarks in 8ish categories;\nI go very far to have everything at hand before I start; online\nlearning is top-down; I get stuck early",
      "originalText": "• The problem, in detail: I search, collect and sort sources, then never look at them again; about 120 bookmarks in 8ish categories; I go very far to have everything at hand before I start; online learning is top-down; I get stuck early",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a18-card-gw-t8",
      "type": "text",
